# An activation-scoped fact, emitted directly ([LSCP.3.2]). Two Requests for
# one `who`, a pump apart, emit one identity; `control` fires on every
# Request; the Other emits the same identity through `work_b`; the last
# Request is a distinct identity.
assert Request who=alpha n=1
pump
advance 10000000000
assert Request who=alpha n=2
pump
advance 10000000000
assert Other who=alpha n=3
pump
advance 10000000000
assert Request who=beta n=4
pump
